{
  "$schema": "../../templates/libs-catalog.schema.json",
  "stackId": "next",
  "category": "fullstack",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "buildSystem": "npm",
  "manifest": {
    "files": [
      "workspace/src/{AppName}/package.json",
      "workspace/src/{AppName}/next.config.mjs",
      "workspace/src/{AppName}/tsconfig.json",
      "workspace/src/{AppName}/components.json"
    ]
  },
  "metadata": {
    "platforms": [
      "node-22"
    ],
    "framework": "Next.js 15 App Router + RSC + Server Actions",
    "workflow": "single-project-ssr-rsc",
    "notes": "Build step obligatoire (next build). Turbopack/Webpack 5 integre. shadcn/ui via composants react.libs.json equivalent.",
    "lastUpdated": "2026-09-02",
    "changeLog": [
      "2026-09-02 — Audit fullstack. Rebase npm complet (Next 15.1.0 -> 16.3.4). PRERELEASE CORRIGEE : `next-auth` etait pinne en 5.0.0-beta.25, en violation de rules/library-and-stack.md 5 (« prerelease sans ADR interdite ») — c'etait l'un des deux WARN PRERELEASE que remontait validate_libs_catalog.py. Le dist-tag npm `latest` de next-auth pointe sur la 4.24.15 STABLE ; la ligne 5 reste en beta (beta.32 a ce jour). La 4.24.15 declare `next: ^12 || ^13 || ^14 || ^15 || ^16` et `react: ^17 || ^18 || ^19` : elle est donc pleinement compatible avec Next 16 + React 19. Passer en next-auth 5 exige un ADR explicite. TypeScript pinne 6.0.3 et non 7.0.2 (coherence avec les autres stacks TS de l'audit). Prisma 7.10.0 : le dist-tag `latest` de `prisma` pointe sur 8.0.0-rc (cf. backend/node-express).",
      "2026-09-02 (rectificatif du meme audit) — CORRECTION DE COHERENCE. Le premier passage avait monte ce stack d'une MAJEURE. C'est incoherent avec la politique appliquee aux autres stacks 🟢 du meme audit (backend/kotlin-spring-boot reste en 3.5.x face a Spring Boot 4.1.1, backend/node-express reste en 4.x face a Express 5.2.1) : une majeure invalide la validation runtime qui porte le badge, et aucun bench ne peut etre re-joue ici. Le stack est donc ramene sur le DERNIER PATCH de sa majeure en place. La montee de majeure reste disponible en tache dediee, avec re-bench. Next reste sur la ligne 15 (15.5.25). Restent bumpes : react 19.2.3, tailwind 4.3.3, zod 4.5.4, prisma 7.10.0 — aucun n'est le framework porteur du bench. next-auth reste corrige en 4.24.15 (la 5.0.0-beta.25 violait l'interdiction de prerelease, cf. entree precedente)."
    ]
  },
  "versions": {
    "next": "15.5.25",
    "react": "19.2.3",
    "react-types": "19.2.18",
    "react-dom-types": "19.2.5",
    "typescript": "5.9.3",
    "node-types": "26.4.1",
    "tailwindcss": "4.3.3",
    "postcss": "8.5.26",
    "zod": "4.5.4",
    "react-hook-form": "7.87.0",
    "hookform-resolvers": "5.9.1",
    "next-auth": "4.24.15",
    "next-intl": "3.26.5",
    "pino": "10.3.1",
    "pino-pretty": "13.1.3",
    "eslint": "10.9.1",
    "eslint-next": "15.5.25",
    "prisma": "7.10.0",
    "prisma-client": "7.10.0",
    "msal-node": "3.8.10",
    "jose": "5.10.0",
    "undici": "7.29.0",
    "exceljs": "4.4.0",
    "react-pdf": "4.9.0",
    "nodemailer": "6.10.1",
    "date-fns": "4.4.0",
    "zustand": "5.0.15",
    "vercel-analytics": "1.4.1"
  },
  "core": [
    {
      "module": "next",
      "ref": "next",
      "rationale": "Framework App Router + RSC + Server Actions"
    },
    {
      "module": "react",
      "ref": "react",
      "rationale": "UI lib compatible RSC"
    },
    {
      "module": "react-dom",
      "ref": "react"
    },
    {
      "module": "@types/react",
      "ref": "react-types"
    },
    {
      "module": "@types/react-dom",
      "ref": "react-dom-types"
    },
    {
      "module": "@types/node",
      "ref": "node-types"
    },
    {
      "module": "typescript",
      "ref": "typescript"
    },
    {
      "module": "tailwindcss",
      "ref": "tailwindcss"
    },
    {
      "module": "@tailwindcss/postcss",
      "ref": "tailwindcss"
    },
    {
      "module": "postcss",
      "ref": "postcss"
    },
    {
      "module": "zod",
      "ref": "zod",
      "rationale": "Validation schemas (server + client)"
    },
    {
      "module": "react-hook-form",
      "ref": "react-hook-form"
    },
    {
      "module": "@hookform/resolvers",
      "ref": "hookform-resolvers"
    },
    {
      "module": "next-auth",
      "ref": "next-auth",
      "rationale": "Auth (NextAuth v5 / Auth.js)"
    },
    {
      "module": "next-intl",
      "ref": "next-intl",
      "rationale": "i18n"
    },
    {
      "module": "pino",
      "ref": "pino"
    },
    {
      "module": "pino-pretty",
      "ref": "pino-pretty"
    },
    {
      "module": "eslint",
      "ref": "eslint"
    },
    {
      "module": "eslint-config-next",
      "ref": "eslint-next"
    }
  ],
  "onDemand": [
    {
      "module": "prisma",
      "ref": "prisma",
      "capability": "prisma",
      "triggers": [
        "DatabaseType.*\\b(SqlServer|PostgreSql|MySql|Sqlite)\\b",
        "orm",
        "db-first"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "@prisma/client",
      "ref": "prisma-client",
      "capability": "prisma",
      "triggers": [
        "prisma",
        "orm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "@azure/msal-node",
      "ref": "msal-node",
      "capability": "auth-azure-ad",
      "triggers": [
        "auth-azure-ad",
        "msal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "jose",
      "ref": "jose",
      "capability": "jwt",
      "triggers": [
        "\\bjwt\\b",
        "auth-local"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "undici",
      "ref": "undici",
      "capability": "http-client",
      "triggers": [
        "appel.*api.*externe",
        "http-client"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "exceljs",
      "ref": "exceljs",
      "capability": "excel",
      "triggers": [
        "\\bexcel\\b",
        "\\.xlsx\\b",
        "export.*excel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "@react-pdf/renderer",
      "ref": "react-pdf",
      "capability": "pdf",
      "triggers": [
        "\\bpdf\\b",
        "export.*pdf"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "nodemailer",
      "ref": "nodemailer",
      "capability": "smtp",
      "triggers": [
        "email",
        "smtp",
        "envoi.*mail"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "date-fns",
      "ref": "date-fns",
      "capability": "date-utils",
      "triggers": [
        "dates.*format",
        "duree",
        "intervalle.*temps"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "zustand",
      "ref": "zustand",
      "capability": "state-mgmt",
      "triggers": [
        "global.*state",
        "store",
        "zustand"
      ]
    },
    {
      "module": "@vercel/analytics",
      "ref": "vercel-analytics",
      "capability": "analytics",
      "triggers": [
        "analytics",
        "telemetry.*ui"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
